  'New Feature: Multi-Aide Sanctuary': '新機能：Multi-Aide Sanctuary（マルチ親衛サンクチュアリ）',
  'New Feature: New Vanguard Growth Support Event': '新機能：新規親衛育成支援イベント',
  'New Feature: Priority Target': '新機能：Priority Target（優先目標）',
  'New Feature: TPS View': '新機能：TPS View（三人称視点）',
  'New Pass: Agent Kim Ga-young Pass': '新規パス：Agent Kim Ga-young Pass',
  'New Pass: Forge Elemental Efreeti Pass': '新規パス：Forge Elemental Efreeti Pass',
  'New Pass: Liberated Prisoner Pass': '新規パス：Liberated Prisoner Pass',
  'New Pass: Mind\'s Eye Lisandria': '新規パス：Mind’s Eye Lisandria',
  'New Pass: Radiant Swordmaiden Eugenia Pass': '新規パス：Radiant Swordmaiden Eugenia Pass',
  'New Pass: Winter Duchess Ines Pass': '新規パス：Winter Duchess Ines Pass',
  'New Event Pass: Bella Pass': '新規イベントパス：Bella Pass',
  '신규 패스 : 사마리카 패스': '新規パス：サマリカパス（Samarika Pass）',
